# SecurePrint AI Documentation

## Overview

SecurePrint AI is a cybersecurity-focused additive manufacturing platform that combines artificial intelligence, blockchain traceability, intellectual property protection, anomaly detection, and compliance automation.

The platform helps organizations secure the entire manufacturing lifecycle, from design protection to production monitoring and supply-chain verification.

