## backend/api/app.py

### Purpose

Primary backend API service.

### Responsibilities

* JWT authentication
* Quality inspection endpoints
* Design encryption endpoints
* Digital signature operations
* Part registration
* Part verification
* Security event retrieval
* G-code threat analysis
* Compliance reporting
* Dashboard statistics

### Framework

Flask

### Authentication

JWT-based authentication.

### Major API Endpoints

#### Authentication

```http
POST /api/auth/login
```

Returns authentication token.

---

#### Quality Inspection

```http
POST /api/quality/inspect
```

Submits images for defect analysis.

---

#### Intellectual Property

```http
POST /api/ip/encrypt
POST /api/ip/sign
```

Protects design files.

---

#### Supply Chain

```http
POST /api/supply-chain/register-part
POST /api/supply-chain/verify-part
```

Blockchain verification.

---

#### Security

```http
POST /api/security/analyze-gcode
GET /api/security/events
```

Threat analysis.

---

#### Compliance

```http
GET /api/compliance/report
```

Generates compliance evidence.

---

#### Dashboard

```http
GET /api/dashboard/stats
```

Returns operational metrics.

