## backend/ml/ip_protection.py

### Purpose

Protects digital manufacturing assets.

### Features

#### AES-256-GCM Encryption

Secures CAD and manufacturing files.

#### RSA Digital Signatures

Provides authenticity validation.

#### Invisible Watermarking

Embeds ownership metadata.

#### Perceptual Hashing

Detects unauthorized duplication.

#### Content Addressing

Supports distributed storage systems.

### Supported Formats

* STL
* STEP
* OBJ

### Security Functions

| Function  | Purpose             |
| --------- | ------------------- |
| Encrypt   | Confidentiality     |
| Sign      | Authenticity        |
| Verify    | Integrity           |
| Watermark | Ownership           |
| Hash      | Duplicate detection |

