## backend/blockchain/fabric_client.py

### Purpose

Blockchain-based supply-chain authentication layer.

### Features

#### Manufacturing Fingerprints

Creates SHA-256 identifiers for parts.

#### Tamper-Evident Ledger

Maintains immutable event history.

#### Merkle Tree Validation

Ensures record integrity.

#### Counterfeit Detection

Validates authenticity.

#### Quality Certification

Stores inspection evidence.

### Core Operations

#### Register Part

Creates blockchain record.

#### Verify Part

Checks authenticity.

#### Retrieve History

Returns lifecycle events.

### Benefits

* Traceability
* Auditability
* Counterfeit prevention
* Chain-of-custody tracking

